  "system": {
    "category": "technique",
    "source": "Bad Eden Heritages v1.1 (RFI-native rules)",
    "tags": [],
    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-canon-echo-diver=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div><p><em>\"You are harder to move than most people are willing to try for.\"</em></p><p><strong>Object Sense (passive).</strong> You passively know, without rolling, the approximate age and structural integrity of any object you touch.</p><p><strong>Stone Patience (1/Soma Break).</strong> Bonus action — anchor yourself until the start of your next turn. You cannot be moved against your will, knocked Prone, or made Shaken. Forced-movement effects targeting you fail cleanly; the aggressor knows it.</p><div data-ft-per-use=\"1\" data-ft-per-use-key=\"echoDivTellurianStonePatience\" style=\"margin-top:0.7rem;padding:0.55rem 0.75rem;border:1px solid #b08acc;border-radius:0.35rem;background:rgba(70,55,95,0.18);\"><p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #d4b8e8; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; font-size: 0.78rem\">⟁ Per-Use Ability — <strong>Stone Patience</strong></span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.92; line-height: 1.4; font-size: 0.86rem\"><strong>Recovery:</strong> 1/Soma Break (active) + passive object sense  ·  <strong>Action:</strong> Picker (Stone Patience · Object Sense)  ·  <strong>Use:</strong> Click this feature on your sheet to invoke.</span> <span style=\"opacity: 0.85; margin-top: 0.3rem; font-size: 0.82rem\">Active: bonus-action anchor — immune to forced movement, Prone, Shaken until next turn. Passive: GM tells you age & structural integrity of any object you touch.</span></p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
